“Director” – means person holding the title of Director, Senior Director or Deputy Commissioner and also includes the Chief of Fire Rescue Services;
“Commissioner” – means person holding the title of Commissioner;
“Fees & Charges By-law” – means the Fees & Charges By-law (By-law No. 2024-095) of the City, as amended from time to time, or any successor thereof;
“Facility Rental Discount Policy” – means Policy M-001, Facility Rental Discount Policy, of the City, as amended from time to time, or any successor thereof;
“Financial Policy” – means Policy FC-002, Financial Requests Outside of the Budget Process, of the City, as amended from time to time, or any successor thereof;
“Generation Park Waterloo” means the Industrial Park formerly referred to as the West Side Employment lands, and outlined by Registered Plan 58M704 municipally known as 928, 960, 980 Erb Street West, 975 Columbia Street West and 100 The Wilmot Line;
“Grant Policy” – means Policy FC-004, Grant Policy, of the City, as amended from time to time, or any successor thereof;
“Museum” – means City of Waterloo Museum as defined by the City Museum By-law No. 2016-002, as amended from time to time, or any successor thereof;
“Museum By-law” – means the By-law to Facilitate Ownership, Operation and Management of the City of Waterloo Museum (By-law No. 2016-002) of the City, as amended from time to time, or any successor thereof;
