“Sponsorship and Advertising Policy” – means Policy A-016, Sponsorship and Advertising Policy, of the City, as amended from time to time, or any successor thereof;
“Sustainability Standards” means the standards that were approved by Council pursuant to Report CAO2022-008 and to which compliance is required for any future development within Generation Park Waterloo.
“Treasurer” – means the City Treasurer/Senior Director of Revenue and Accounting of the City;
An original copy of any document executed pursuant to this By-law shall be forthwith deposited with the City Clerk for safekeeping immediately following its execution if such document is identified in this By-law as a document which must be deposited with Clerks. Documents to be deposited with the City are Clerk are identified in the Schedules with an asterisk (*).
Nothing in this By-law shall be interpreted to invalidate any document executed by any City Official where such execution was performed in accordance with any other Bylaw, Rule of Law, or applicable statutory authority.
